OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy but dry across the region
OL,7,Fthrough the evening. Dry with clear
OL,8,Fspells lingering overnight with patchy
OL,9,Fmist and fog developing. Cool
OL,10,Fovernight, particularly for rural
OL,11,Fareas.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FDry with sunny spells to
OL,14,Fstart. Cloud builds and while many
OL,15,Fareas remain dry, isolated heavy
OL,16,Fshowers may develop in the far east
OL,17,Fthrough the afternoon. Clear and cold
OL,18,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
