OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FFine
OL,6,Fand sunny on Thursday after a chilly
OL,7,Fstart. Breezy with isolated outbreaks
OL,8,Fof rain Friday. Chilly with early fog
OL,9,Fpatches on Saturday, giving way to
OL,10,Fsunny spells later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
